Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.09,0:02:22.47,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur1.95}Não quero que ninguém seja morto
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.76,0:02:30.37,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur1.95}Irei te trazer de volta, pois estou sempre pronta para lutar
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.02,0:02:36.40,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur1.95}Por isso, não se culpe tanto, estávamos todos errados
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.40,0:02:39.78,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur1.95}Portanto, não carregue todo esse peso, como sempre faz
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.78,0:02:43.78,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur1.95}Sempre haverá algo que você não pode controlar
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.78,0:02:48.16,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur1.95}Vamos triunfar, sua salvação começou
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.41,0:02:54.29,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur1.95}Sem sinais, sem luzes, há tanta confusão
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.29,0:02:56.29,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,360)\blur1.95}Não destrua suas esperanças
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.29,0:03:02.05,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur1.95}Você me faz perceber de quem eu preciso
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.43,0:03:06.64,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,180)\blur1.95}Estarei lá, aguente firme, eles tentarão te mudar
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.72,0:03:09.81,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur1.95}Onde você está agora?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.81,0:03:12.44,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,80)\blur1.95}Te alcançarei ao amanhecer
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.44,0:03:14.31,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,180)\blur1.95}As sombras aparecem
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.31,0:03:17.52,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur1.95}Ilusões nascem
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.28,0:03:21.65,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,120)\blur1.95}Os anjos caídos que te acompanham não sabem
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.65,0:03:26.10,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,180)\blur1.95}É a nossa dor que nos torna humanos, afinal
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.10,0:03:29.08,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur1.95}Fotografias em sépia antigas mostram
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.08,0:03:31.08,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,110)\blur1.95}Nosso frágil mundo precioso
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.08,0:03:34.92,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,540)\blur1.95}Que descartamos ao responder o chamado
